	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Erreur lors d'un dump]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=4652#p4652"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ah mince, y&#039;a un s en trop et c&#039;est pg_class qu&#039;il faut mettre à jour. On recommence :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>update pg_class
set reltrigger=(select count(*) from pg_trigger where tgrelid=pg_class.oid)
where
  reltriggers&gt;0
and
  reltriggers != (select count(*) from pg_trigger where tgrelid=pg_class.oid);</code></pre></div>]]></content>
